    "body": "This release is available through Maven Central as `com.tom-roush.pdfbox-android:2.0.26.0`\r\n\r\n## Major Changes\r\n* Upgrade PDFBox API to 2.0.26 by @TomRoush in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/429\r\n\r\n* Add support for annotation opacity via constantOpacity  by @jaranflaath in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/419\r\n* Update R8/ProGuard rules to avoid crash in release by @rzimmer in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/443\r\n\r\n## Dependency Changes\r\n* Bump gradle from 7.2.1 to 7.2.2 by @dependabot in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/432\r\n* Bump bcutil-jdk15to18 from 1.70 to 1.72 by @dependabot in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/447\r\n* Bump bcpkix-jdk15to18 from 1.70 to 1.72 by @dependabot in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/448\r\n* Bump bcprov-jdk15to18 from 1.70 to 1.72 by @dependabot in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/449\r\n* Bump gradle from 7.2.2 to 7.3.1 by @dependabot in https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/pull/451 (also bumps API level to 33)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TomRoush/PdfBox-Android/compare/v2.0.25.0...v2.0.26.0\r\n**PDFBox Changelog**: [2.0.26](https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ReleaseNote.jspa?projectId=12310760&version=12350925)",
